flowchart TD
  Request[Workshop IDs] --> Metadata[Fetch Steam metadata]
  Metadata --> Available{Available and downloadable?}
  Available -->|permanently unavailable| Delete[Mark associated items deleted]
  Available -->|inaccessible| Inaccessible[Mark items deleted for visibility]
  Available -->|yes| Batch[Split IDs into download batches]
  Batch --> Download[Download with SteamCMD]
  Download --> Parse[Discover and parse level files]
  Parse --> Persist[Upsert levels, items, metadata, and thumbnails]
  Persist --> Missing[Mark no-longer-downloaded files deleted]
  Download -->|batch failure| Split{More than one item?}
  Split -->|yes| Batch
  Split -->|one item| Failure[Return transient failure without deleting]
  Delete --> Result[Return scan status and changed IDs]
  Inaccessible --> Result
  Missing --> Result
  Failure --> Result
